# Compact (default): the Admin Portal is proxied to the same origin's
# /api/ location as the User Portal (both-mode backend) — see
# docs/security-model.md for why Compact is NOT a real network boundary
# despite the Admin Portal existing at its own /admin/ sub-path there.
# Segmented deployments point this at the Admin API's own origin instead,
# e.g. https://admin.openrbi.local/api, reachable only from a management
# network (see docs/deployment.md#compact-vs-segmented-productization-v011).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
